      "description": "One poll of one drafting review log (a Contributor Feedback sheet) and\nits folio repository. A tool decides, with no agent judgement, whether\nanything a person set in the sheet or any open issue changed since the\nlast poll. Only then does the agent append rows for new issues and do\nits pass. Skill: review-log-watch.",
